{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EST","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以斯帖记","commonName":"以斯帖记","title":"以斯帖记","order":17,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"e3224a0415c8a14cc019c1016693c7a4c7be84e41b0007ea86e9d9e1011311da","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EST/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EST/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":165},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["哈曼被处死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["王带着哈曼来赴王后以斯帖的筵席。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这第二次在酒席筵前，王又问以斯帖说：「王后以斯帖啊，你要什么，我必赐给你；你求什么，就是国的一半也必为你成就。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["王后以斯帖回答说：「我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若以为美，我所愿的，是愿王将我的性命赐给我；我所求的，是求王将我的本族赐给我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因我和我的本族被卖了，要剪除杀戮灭绝我们。我们若被卖为奴为婢，我也闭口不言；但王的损失，敌人万不能补足。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亚哈随鲁王问王后以斯帖说：「擅敢起意如此行的是谁？这人在哪里呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以斯帖说：「仇人敌人就是这恶人哈曼！」 哈曼在王和王后面前就甚惊惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["王便大怒，起来离开酒席往御园去了。哈曼见王定意要加罪与他，就起来，求王后以斯帖救命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["王从御园回到酒席之处，见哈曼伏在以斯帖所靠的榻上；王说：「他竟敢在宫内、在我面前凌辱王后吗？」这话一出王口，人就蒙了哈曼的脸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["伺候王的一个太监名叫哈波拿，说：「哈曼为那救王有功的末底改做了五丈高的木架，现今立在哈曼家里。」王说：「把哈曼挂在其上。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["于是人将哈曼挂在他为末底改所预备的木架上。王的忿怒这才止息。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EST/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EST/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EST/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}